# The extension talks directly to Supabase Edge Functions; no local backend
# is run. The variables below are configured on the Supabase project (Edge
# Functions → Secrets), not in a local .env file:
#
#   SHOPIFY_API_SECRET          - app's API secret (HS256 signing key)
#   SHOPIFY_API_KEY             - app's client_id (matches `aud` in session tokens)
#   SUPABASE_URL                - injected automatically by Supabase
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   - injected automatically by Supabase
#
# A Shopify shop is granted access by mapping its myshopify.com domain to a
# PODHero account_id in the `accounts.shop_domain` column.
